/// GoogleAdsSearchads360V23ResourcesUserList: A user list. This is a list of users a customer may target. The unique key of a user list consists of the following fields: `id`. Note that the `name` must also be unique for user lists owned by a given customer, except in some cases where `access_reason` is set to `SHARED`. Violating the unique name constraint produces error: `UserListError.INVALID_NAME`.
